PubMed:23022480, PubMed:23190533, PubMed:26213367, PubMed:28887445, PubMed:30215753, PubMed:31832688). In addition also removes uridines from the 3' end of U6atac snRNA and possibly the vault RNA VTRNA1-1 (PubMed:26213367)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}